{"“I wish it left sooner,” Sophie said, “but Lyon will have to do.” Sooner? Langdon checked his watch \0032:59 A.M.\004 The train left in seven minutes and they didn’t even have tickets yet.","The DaVinci Code","Dan Brown",true},
